1307
01:23:33.500 --> 01:23:35.792
<i>High. Cleveland, Columbus.</i>

1308
01:23:35.875 --> 01:23:39.333
<i>That's primary, of course.
Still assessing the prevailing winds.</i>

1309
01:23:39.417 --> 01:23:40.667
<i>Jesus Christ.</i>

1310
01:23:41.667 --> 01:23:45.208
<i>This is why we have the GBIs.
No need to panic people.</i>

1311
01:23:45.708 --> 01:23:47.292
