That's what $50 billion buys us?

1332
01:24:54.375 --> 01:24:56.667
{\an8}<i>We're talking about
hitting a bullet with a bullet.</i>

1333
01:24:56.750 --> 01:24:59.250
{\an8}<i>Hello? Hello? Can anyone hear me?</i>

1334
