- I can try National Guard.
- Find Carrie.

1340
01:25:22.000 --> 01:25:25.000
- I'll try. I will call.
- They're saying it's 15 minutes. Hurry.

1341
01:25:26.958 --> 01:25:28.292
Reid, are you still there?

1342
01:25:29.208 --> 01:25:31.083
Yeah, uh, yeah. Yeah, I'm here.

1343
01:25:31.792 --> 01:25:32.833
Oh.

1344
01:25:32.917 --> 01:25:35.417
- Yeah, I'm here. I'm here.
- <i>What do you make of this?</i>

1345
01:25:35.500 --> 01:25:37.583
-I really don't know
-<i>Don't know?</i>

1346
