You're running the fucking Pentagon.

1347
01:25:40.083 --> 01:25:42.625
<i>They had one briefing
when I was sworn in. One.</i>

1348
01:25:42.708 --> 01:25:44.417
And they told me that's the protocol.

1349
01:25:44.917 --> 01:25:46.583
<i>They told me the same thing.</i>

1350
01:25:47.250 --> 01:25:50.375
Shit, I got a whole fucking briefing
