1354
01:25:58.625 --> 01:26:01.083
<i>We focused on more likely scenarios.</i>

1355
01:26:01.167 --> 01:26:03.083
Things we might actually
have to deal with.

1356
01:26:03.167 --> 01:26:04.333
<i>Yeah, with this.</i>

1357
01:26:04.417 --> 01:26:06.875
Best I can remember, we follow the steps.

1358
01:26:06.958 --> 01:26:09.000
We… we're following procedure.

1359
