1364
01:26:21.583 --> 01:26:24.000
I understand that you're…
you're the expert.

1365
01:26:24.083 --> 01:26:25.667
<i>There was a launch, A...</i>

1366
01:26:37.042 --> 01:26:38.500
- Hi.
- <i>Hey, leave a message.</i>

1367
01:26:38.583 --> 01:26:40.667
Please don't send me to voicemail.

1368
01:26:41.167 --> 01:26:44.208
It's your father.
It's an emergency. Call me.

1369
01:26:50.792 --> 01:26:52.083
Did you reach anyone?

1370
01:26:52.167 --> 01:26:54.417
I'm on with Great Lakes Naval Station.

1371
01:26:55.083 --> 01:26:58.125
- Maybe they can trace her phone.
- Transport's ready. Let's go, sir.

1372
01:26:58.208 --> 01:27:00.458
