1377
01:27:11.417 --> 01:27:13.542
<i>…enough of this. This is a waste of time.</i>

1378
01:27:13.625 --> 01:27:15.958
<i>Sir, a cyber expert could potentially...</i>

1379
01:27:16.042 --> 01:27:18.667
Yeah, well, find one, okay?

1380
01:27:18.750 --> 01:27:21.667
<i>EKV has separated from the first GBI.</i>

1381
01:27:22.292 --> 01:27:23.708
