1382
01:27:28.583 --> 01:27:30.083
This better fucking work.

1383
01:27:47.417 --> 01:27:49.042
<i>How will we know, Tony?</i>

1384
01:27:49.125 --> 01:27:50.167
<i>Give me a second.</i>

1385
01:27:50.250 --> 01:27:52.458
<i>We'll get the MDB on speaker
