1386
01:27:59.583 --> 01:28:01.500
Four minutes to the LZ, sir.

1387
01:28:02.333 --> 01:28:03.708
<i>Ten seconds.</i>

1388
01:28:04.500 --> 01:28:05.500
<i>Nine.</i>

1389
01:28:06.000 --> 01:28:08.833
<i>- Eight. Seven.
- Listen, with the chips...</i>

1390
01:28:08.917 --> 01:28:11.125
<i>- We're good, man. I'm a slob.
- Six. Five…</i>

1391
01:28:11.208 --> 01:28:13.500
<i>To hell with her.
Shouldn't have left it like that.</i>

1392
01:28:14.083 --> 01:28:15.083
<i>Three.</i>

1393
01:28:15.583 --> 01:28:16.583
<i>Two.</i>

1394
01:28:17.583 --> 01:28:18.708
<i>One.</i>

1395
01:28:27.458 --> 01:28:30.625
<i>Confirm impact.</i>

1396
01:28:31.875 --> 01:28:34.125
<i>- Confirm impact.
- Stand by. Confirming.</i>

1397
01:28:37.542 --> 01:28:39.250
<i>Come on. What are you waiting for?</i>

1398
01:28:42.458 --> 01:28:44.208
<i>- It's negative.
- What'd he say?</i>

1399
01:28:45.250 --> 01:28:46.333
<i>What'd he say?</i>

1400
01:28:47.667 --> 01:28:48.667
<i>I, uh…</i>

1401
01:28:49.375 --> 01:28:50.542
<i>A negative impact.</i>

1402
01:28:51.583 --> 01:28:53.083
<i>Object remains inbound.</i>

1403
01:29:01.792 --> 01:29:03.958
<i>We did every fucking thing right.</i>

1404
01:29:04.458 --> 01:29:07.417
<i>Mr. President, confirming DEFCON 1, sir.</i>

1405
01:29:08.042 --> 01:29:10.500
<i>Oh Jesus. We just went DEFCON 1.</i>

1406
01:29:10.583 --> 01:29:12.708
<i>- Okay.
- Negative impact.</i>

1407
01:29:12.792 --> 01:29:13.833
Confirming.

1408
01:29:13.917 --> 01:29:15.042
Uh…

1409
01:29:20.667 --> 01:29:23.792
<i>Major, confirm the release
of two additional GBIs to intercept.</i>

1410
01:29:27.042 --> 01:29:28.708
Why the hell is that book out, son?

1411
01:29:28.792 --> 01:29:32.167
<i>Mr. President, significant time
and expertise were devoted</i>

1412
01:29:32.250 --> 01:29:33.958
<i>to designing these options.</i>

1413
01:29:34.042 --> 01:29:37.292
<i>You'll find a range,
select, limited, and major,</i>

1414
01:29:37.375 --> 01:29:40.208
<i>depending on the scale of the response
you feel is warranted.</i>

1415
01:29:40.292 --> 01:29:43.625
<i>I suggest you allow
Lieutenant Commander Reeves to brief you.</i>

1416
01:29:43.708 --> 01:29:47.583
Per the provisions
of OPLAN 8044, Revision 25,

